      "text": "Ground your energy\nRaise your vibration to the higher frequency of love and light\nYou can not heal your body with a chaotic life\nYour body heals through rhythms:\nSleep\nDigestion\nElimination\nEnergy\nThe nervous system responds to patterns the body recognises\nA busy life scrambles the rhythm\nLate nights\nSkipped meals\nRushing\nThe body never knows what’s coming next.\n\nStart each day with three anchors -\n1. Wake up at the same time\n2. Eat meals at the same time\n3. Wind down at the same time\nPredictability helps the body find its rhythm again.\n\nCreate one small ritual your body can rely on\nMorning sunlight\nA walk after lunch\nA cup of tea at sunset\nFive quiet minutes listening to your breath before bed\nIt doesn’t need to be elaborate, it needs to be consistent\nBuild rhythms slowly\nChoose one, repeat until it feels natural, then add another\nHealing is built through mindful consistency\nAyurveda teaches consistency is medicine\nA rhythmic life gives the body something it can not find in chaos\nA sense of safety.\nWhen the conditions are safe, the body can heal.\nMindset is medicine.",
